            <ArticleTitle>Synthesis of some triazolyl-antipyrine derivatives and investigation of analgesic activity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>685-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The synthesis of some triazolyl-antipyrine derivatives starting from 4-chloroacetamidoantipyrine and 3-(aryloxyalkyl)-4-ethyl/phenyl-5-mercapto-1,2,4-triazoles is described. The chemical structures of the compounds were elucidated by IR, 1H-NMR and mass spectral studies. These compounds were tested for analgesic activity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
